  "description": "Executable request fields from the runtime Zod contract. Conditional requirements and clinical workflow transitions are also checked by the engine. Use the named examples as a starting point, choose a permitted site, and copy current resource IDs/versions from a workspace response. All drug prices are integer pence. No clinical advice is provided."
